				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Comment" "RUN/PROGRAM slide switch, SIGNALS ONLY (rated 0.3 A: it no longer carries the +5V current). Pole A common (pad4) = GND; pos1=RUN: pad1 (SW_RUN) to GND turns the BUCK_5V load switch on and pad5 (PD_CFG1) to GND requests 12V; pos2=middle=all open (both load switches off, PD requests 5V via R73); pos3=PROGRAM: pad3 (SW_PGM) to GND turns the VBUS_PD load switch on (PD_CFG1 left open = 5V request; pad6 stays NC: CH224A CFG1 max 3.8V). Pad pairing 1&8/2&7/3&6 confirmed against the G-Switch circuit drawing (two bars move together); which lever end is RUN/PGM must still be checked on a real part. JP3 is NOT linked."
			(at 490.22 820.42 0)
			(effects
